name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q5_2026'

question 'A coffee shop app shows a running total at the top of the screen. Every time the user taps a drink, the total updates. What is the app using to make this work?'

wrong 'A fixed value that the developer changes manually each day.'
right 'A variable that stores the total and is updated and re-displayed each time a drink is added.'
wrong 'The page reloads from the server with a new total each time.'
wrong 'A timer that refreshes the screen every second.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

